      "description": "Hello, beauty lover. Welcome to Sephora UK\n\nWhether you’re here for our new brands, trending-now beauty picks, or exclusive offers, you can now shop your favorite skincare, makeup, hair and fragrance products all in one place. Refresh your skin, select a sunny new scent, or get your glow on - the choice is all yours.\n\nDiscover Sephora exclusive brands from our own beauty powerhouse Sephora Collections to makeup artist-beloved Makeup by Mario, Ilia, Tarte, ONE/SIZE and so much more.  \n\nEasily shop for your beauty needs, from best-selling brands like Elemis, Charlotte Tilbury and La Roche Posay and find the perfect moisturiser, foundation, mascara, or concealer for you.\n\nYou’ll even discover our specially curated guides, tips and insider content to last you from day to night, summer to winter - no matter whoever or wherever you are, express each unique part of you with the Sephora app by your side.\n\n\n\nSephora Features:\nWith over 35,000 beauty products at your finger tips, here's why Sephora is your destination for all things beauty - and how to get the most out of it.\n\nSEPHORA COLLECTIONS\nYou can shop our you-first Sephora Collections from the app. Showcasing the best in premium products offering beauty power for all, your skin, hair and makeup will be glowing in a whole new way.\n\nSEPHORA REWARDS\nTreat yourself and be rewarded on every purchase with Sephora REWARDS, Get a £5 voucher for every £75 you spend on site, 10% off your two chosen brands for life and an exclusive birthday treat\n\nSEPHORA BEAUTY BOX\nThe ultimate 'to me, from me' gift, Sephora Beauty Box is the subscription service that puts you in control.Choose five deluxe samples you really want to try with a flexible subscription length that suits you.  \n\nPREMIER DELIVERY\nWant to fast-track your faves? Sign up for Premier Delivery and get a whole year of next-day deliveries for just £9.95\n\nSKINCARE\nNo matter your skin type or budget, refresh your complexion with our glow-first range.\n• Complete your perfect skincare routine from your cleanser, toner and serum to your moisturiser, treatment mask and SPF lotion\n• Treat acne, dark spots, dryness & pores with our top-rated products\n• Shop from leading skincare brands like The Ordinary, Elemis, Cerave, The Inkey List, Kiehl’s & many more!\n\n\nMAKEUP & COSMETICS\nWhether you prefer that barely-there look or a full face finish, we'll help you build your best base, highlight your fave features and get ready to face the world,\n\n• Best-selling brands like Huda, Benefit Cosmetics, Milk Makeup, Nars & many more!\n\n• Browse palettes, lipstick, mascara, concealer, eyeliners, setting sprays & more to suit every beauty budget\n\n- Apply your makeup like a dream with the right brushes and tools. The best brushes are designed to help you achieve absolute perfection (and you can never have too many).\n\n\nFRAGRANCE\n\n• Buy all-time favorite fragrances or try a fresh new signature scent\n\n• Luxurious scents from DIOR, Maison Margiela, GIVENCHY, Lancome, and more\n\n\nHAIR PRODUCTS\nFrom tress-taming treatments to moisture locking masking, these bestsellers will transform your hair.\n\n• Shop from leading haircare brands like Kerastase, Philip Kingsley, John Frieda, Olaplex & more!\n\n- Explore tools to style and treat your hair for effortlessly luscious locks\n\n• Try out the very best conditioners & hair masks\n\n• Shop beautifully packaged sets for the perfect hair care gift\n\nFrom your next go-to scent to each lash lengthening mascara and hydration-boosting night cream, we've got everything you need to transform your beauty routine. All this, plus access to even more exclusive offers. \n\n\nDownload the Sephora UK App now for the best beauty shopping experience.",
